ind":"announcement","title":"More Than Just Building Roads:","summary":"We're a full-time development team of seven people, working to create one of the deepest and most comprehensive road-building systems in gaming history. We've poured years of civil engineering expertise and engineering software technology into ALIGNMENT: An Engineering Odyssey. Not to recreate a complicated engineering application, but to let more people experience the joy of creating real road infrastructure. Here, a road isn't just a curve drawn across the terrain. You can plan routes through ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:26:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031159","verified_at":"2026-10-22T09:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1846651706689312","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"update","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo 0.1.10.4624 Update: Tutorial, Editing Controls, and Stability","summary":"Level 4 Tutorial Guidance Refined the Level 4 tutorial flow, with updated instructions, tutorial videos, directional guidance, and mission dialogue. Expanded localized tutorial text and fixed truncated Japanese text and repeated mission dialogue. Improved the tutorial video interface and video switching. Tutorial content remains under active development. Camera and Editing Controls Improved mouse-wheel zoom and middle-mouse panning, including zooming around the cursor and dragging the map. Camer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:51:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689312","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1846651706676274","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Selected for INDIE Live Expo 2026!","summary":"We’re pleased to announce that ALIGNMENT: An Engineering Odyssey has been chosen as an Official Selection of INDIE Live Expo 2026! The showcase is scheduled for December 1, 2026. Thank you to INDIE Live Expo for recognizing our indie project—and to everyone who has followed the game or tried the demo. Real terrain. Your road. ALIGNMENT is a road-building and driving simulation set in landscapes based on real geographic data. Plan a route through mountains and valleys. Shape hillsides, work with ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1845383656376466","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"update","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo Major Update: Custom Maps, Road Editing, and Live Weather","summary":"Custom Map Import Free Build now supports importing PNG grayscale heightmaps to generate terrain, along with imagery overlays. Bring familiar landscapes into your road-building projects. Live Weather and Terrain Visuals Adjust weather and environmental settings in real time while building. Refined the terrain material system and textures, with improved visual transitions between near and distant terrain. Road, Slope, and Culvert Editing Planar road-design interactions have moved into the viewpor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T06:40:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1840944183778783","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.1.8.3887","summary":"UpdateLog 0.1.8.3884 2026.08.14 Road Editing Added undo and redo for road editing, with UI availability states and shortcut support. Improved road cross-section, road information, and editing feedback. Improved alignment and elevation-profile validation for more stable editing. Bridges & Tunnels Improved hover, selection, and page-switching feedback for bridges and tunnels. Improved tunnel deletion confirmation and change submission. Fixed gaps, partial rebuilding, and display issues between adj","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T07:27:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183778783","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1840310314347204","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.1.8.3821","summary":"UpdateLog 0.1.8.3821 2026.08.08 Vehicles Tesla is now the default vehicle on the Plains Map, with dedicated textures, audio, and reverse cues. Improved AE86 driving feel and audio. Expanded vehicle lighting: clearance lamps, high/low beams, and outline lights; upgraded Tesla lighting presentation. Press R to reset to a nearby road station and align to the current lane. Bridge Editing Bridges can now be deleted, and bridge length can be adjusted directly. Skewed bridge editing is supported; guard","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T10:35:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1839041357031599","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.0.8.3635","summary":"UpdateLog 0.0.8.3623 2026.07.25 🌉 Bridge System Major Upgrade Manual bridge creation now supported — freely add bridges on any road segment, no longer dependent on auto-detection. Bridge skew angle feature live — adjust abutment angle via slider in real time, with guardrail and slope automatically following. Span length manually adjustable — flexible control over bridge length and span arrangement, what you see is what you get. Bridge auto span layout algorithm rewritten — center-aligned standar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T09:30:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357031599","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1837955055358770","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.0.7.3373","summary":"UpdateLog 0.0.7.3373 2026.07.11 Plains Terrain The 8km × 8km eastern plains terrain is now fully open — build interchanges freely with no preset road constraints. Significantly optimized slope creation performance on the plains map for smoother large-scale editing. Road Editing Slope system overhaul: dramatically faster generation, rewritten slope offset logic for more natural slope geometry. Separated road endpoints can now be dragged, with automatic cascading updates to connected alignment ele","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-11T07:31:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055358770","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1836506165570114","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.0.1.3250","summary":"UpdateLog 0.0.1.3250 2026.07.03 Road SystemSeparated Road system now available: split bidirectional ramps into unidirectional ramps, each connecting to different target roads — enabling trumpet interchanges and more. Two editing modes: Merge to Separated and Separated to Merge, for flexible road structure adjustments. Improved ramp connection stability. Editor InteractionNew ramp alignment adjustment tool. New interaction sound effects. Improved interaction hints and guidance to help new users g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T10:34:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1835871199312028","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.0.1.3082","summary":"UpdateLog 0.0.1.3082 2026.06.22 Road Generation Open roads no longer automatically generate barrier meshes, making scene presentation more consistent with real-world road forms. Fixes Fixed interchange ramp connection bugs that caused abnormal ramp-to-mainline junctions under certain conditions. UI Improvements Hidden development debug UI to provide a cleaner in-game interface experience. In Development We are improving support for separated road connections. Future updates will allow two-way ra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T04:02:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312028","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4267650-1835871199303927","game_id":"steam-4267650","kind":"announcement","title":"ALIGNMENT Demo UpdateLog 0.0.1.3072","summary":"UpdateLog 0.0.1.3072 2026.06.18 Experience Improvements Added a configurable mouse wheel speed option for camera zoom. Fixed vehicle low-beam lighting to improve visibility at night and in low-light environments. Adjusted the vehicle driving system for better han